      "statement": "The Desktop is an internal Windows and macOS Tauri 2 preview whose packages are unsigned and not a supported or signed release; it does not close issues #1654 or #1428, and signing, published resources and clean-machine acceptance remain under #2108, #2109 and #2112.",
